OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786983634
OL,3,CFurther cases of potentially deadly
OL,4,Cbluetongue virus found
OL,6,FFollowing the discovery of the
OL,7,Fbluetongue virus in three farms in
OL,8,Fsouthern Scotland, the National
OL,9,FFarmers' Union (NFU) has said that "a
OL,10,Ffurther positive case in the same
OL,11,Fvicinity as the existing cases" has
OL,12,Fbeen identified.
OL,14,FThere are now five animals testing
OL,15,Fpositive with the virus across four
OL,16,Fholdings in Dumfries and Galloway, all
OL,17,Fwithin 2km of each other.
OL,19,FOver 100 animals have now been tested,
OL,20,Fand the results for all but these four
OL,21,Fhave been negative.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/4
