PN,32102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786983634
OL,3,CFurther cases of potentially deadly
OL,4,Cbluetongue virus found
OL,6,FOn this, NFU Scotland said: "While
OL,7,Fthis is encouraging, it remains too
OL,8,Fearly to determine the full extent of
OL,9,FBTV-3 in Scotland."
OL,11,FThe Johnson family, who run
OL,12,FKirkmabreck Farm in Dumfries and
OL,13,FGalloway, confirmed one of their lambs
OL,14,Fhad the virus on 8 August, with a
OL,15,Fsingle lamb affected.
OL,17,FA second case of bluetongue serotype 3
OL,18,F(BTV-3) was later confirmed in two
OL,19,Fsheep on a different farm on 12 August.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/4
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
