OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,322,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786983634
OL,3,CFurther cases of potentially deadly
OL,4,Cbluetongue virus found
OL,6,FThe Scottish Government said all the
OL,7,Ffarms have been placed under
OL,8,Frestriction while investigations
OL,9,Fcontinue.
OL,11,FIt has also confirmed that it does not
OL,12,Fintend to introduce a disease control
OL,13,Fzone at this point, as it currently
OL,14,Fconsiders prevalence to be low.
OL,16,FChief veterinary officer Sheila Voas
OL,17,Fsaid: "Vaccination remains the best
OL,18,Fway of preventing disease in animals,
OL,19,Fand I encourage all farmers to discuss
OL,20,Fthis with their vets."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/4
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
