FL,322,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786983634
OL,3,CFurther cases of potentially deadly
OL,4,Cbluetongue virus found
OL,6,FNFU Scotland said: "Keepers should
OL,7,Fremain vigilant for signs of disease
OL,8,Fin their animals.
OL,10,F"Where bluetongue is suspected in
OL,11,FScotland, livestock keepers must
OL,12,Freport the suspicion to the Animal and
OL,13,FPlant Health Agency (APHA), which will
OL,14,Fadvise on investigation and testing
OL,15,Frequirements."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/4
